      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.92,
          "en": "So as mentioned, this is the project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.92,
          "end": 8.55,
          "en": "the website we're going to build in this section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.55,
          "end": 11.73,
          "en": "And when I say we are going to build it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.73,
          "end": 14.94,
          "en": "I basically mean you are going to build it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.94,
          "end": 18.36,
          "en": "or at least you should try building it first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.36,
          "end": 21,
          "en": "because I got a couple of tasks for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21,
          "end": 23.7,
          "en": "that allow you to practice what you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.7,
          "end": 27.6,
          "en": "Though of course, throughout the rest of this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.6,
          "end": 30.856,
          "en": "I'm going to build this website here together with you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.856,
          "end": 33.96,
          "en": "and you can follow along with me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.96,
          "end": 35.71,
          "en": "to see how I'm tackling those tasks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.696,
          "end": 38.76,
          "en": "and how I am building this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.76,
          "end": 40.53,
          "en": "But that being said, let's now take a look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.53,
          "end": 43.5,
          "en": "this starting project I prepared for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.5,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "and the tasks you should complete with this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 48.54,
          "en": "So here's the starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.54,
          "end": 51.39,
          "en": "and you of course find it attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.39,
          "end": 54.45,
          "en": "You also find a link to Code Sandbox attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.45,
          "end": 56.4,
          "en": "which you can use alternatively",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.4,
          "end": 59.22,
          "en": "if you don't want to install anything locally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.22,
          "end": 62.1,
          "en": "But I'm of course going to use a local environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.1,
          "end": 64.8,
          "en": "as I always do in this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.8,
          "end": 68.22,
          "en": "And in this starting project I am providing to you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.22,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "you'll find a source folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.11,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "with a couple of JavaScript files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 76.08,
          "en": "and an assets folder with a nested images folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.08,
          "end": 81.08,
          "en": "Now the only really relevant file for us is the App.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.783,
          "end": 86.1,
          "en": "In that file here, you'll already find some code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.1,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "and you'll also already find a react component in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "Now this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.00999999999999,
          "en": "and this overall app is not finished though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 95.00999999999999,
          "end": 98.1,
          "en": "Instead here in this component I got a header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.1,
          "end": 102.93,
          "en": "where I output an image and the image is actually imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.93,
          "end": 106.28999999999999,
          "en": "like this from the assets folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.28999999999999,
          "end": 110.43,
          "en": "This is an import syntax you can use in React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.43,
          "end": 113.55,
          "en": "It is supported by the underlying development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.55,
          "end": 114.963,
          "en": "and build process,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 116.167,
          "end": 118.11,
          "en": "and this is how you can use images which are stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.11,
          "end": 122.16,
          "en": "in this assets images folder here in your component files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.16,
          "end": 125.07,
          "en": "You simply import them, assign any name of your choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.07,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "to them, and then you use them as a dynamic source value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 133.14,
          "en": "But that's already in this file of course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.14,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "What's not in this file or what's at least not finished",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 140.43,
          "en": "right now is information about some of those",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.43,
          "end": 143.57999999999998,
          "en": "React key concepts you should be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.57999999999998,
          "end": 147.03,
          "en": "Though I will say that this is just a demo website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.03,
          "end": 149.083,
          "en": "just an exercise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.083,
          "end": 150.57,
          "en": "And this is not an exhaustive list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.57,
          "end": 152.85,
          "en": "of all key React concepts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.85,
          "end": 156.45,
          "en": "Instead, you're going to learn about more React concepts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.45,
          "end": 157.773,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.64,
          "end": 162.03,
          "en": "But anyways here we got an array full of objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.03,
          "end": 165.288,
          "en": "and down here the goal is to output the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.288,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "that's contained in those objects in this array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.69,
          "en": "But at the moment that's not happening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.69,
          "end": 174.66,
          "en": "And that's where your tasks start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.66,
          "end": 179.34,
          "en": "The first task is to output those key concepts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.34,
          "end": 182.28,
          "en": "so that key concepts data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.28,
          "end": 185.325,
          "en": "This data which you find in this area should be output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 185.325,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 190.56,
          "en": "And of course with that, I don't mean that you should copy",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.56,
          "end": 191.97,
          "en": "and paste the text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 193.99,
          "en": "Instead, you should find a different way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 195.011,
          "end": 199.07999999999998,
          "en": "of outputting that data, but that's only the first task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.07999999999998,
          "end": 204.07999999999998,
          "en": "The second task then is to identify possible components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 207.63,
          "en": "you could create, possible JSX code snippets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.63,
          "end": 210.93,
          "en": "you could outsource into a separate component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.93,
          "end": 213.57,
          "en": "For that you should analyze this JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.57,
          "end": 217.74,
          "en": "in the app component and come up with possible components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 220.5,
          "en": "this code could be split up into.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.5,
          "end": 223.62,
          "en": "Now of course identifying possible components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.62,
          "end": 225.39,
          "en": "isn't everything though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.39,
          "end": 229.56,
          "en": "Instead then as a last task in this section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.56,
          "end": 234.09,
          "en": "you should then also create and use those custom components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.09,
          "end": 236.94,
          "en": "So you should create new components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.94,
          "end": 239.76,
          "en": "Also use props if you need to use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.76,
          "end": 243.51,
          "en": "And of course once you went through all these steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.51,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "and once you have a working solution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 248.79,
          "en": "definitely also take a look at the remaining lectures",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 248.79,
          "end": 251.61,
          "en": "in this section because there I will walk you through",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 251.61,
          "end": 254.73,
          "en": "my solution, repeat some core component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.73,
          "end": 256.71,
          "en": "and React concepts you must know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.71,
          "end": 260.82,
          "en": "and of course also let you know why I chose this solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 260.82,
          "end": 263.88,
          "en": "and why I perform certain steps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 263.88,
          "end": 266.394,
          "en": "Now in case you're getting stuck whilst trying this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 266.394,
          "end": 269.79,
          "en": "on your own, also take a look at the next lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 269.79,
          "end": 271.68,
          "en": "so the lecture after this one here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.68,
          "end": 274.74,
          "en": "because that will be a hints lecture where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 274.74,
